c\u5973\u5b50\u30d7\u30ed\u30ec\u30b9; also known as All Japan Women's Pro-Wrestling (AJW)); Japan's female professional wrestling league which was very popular in the late 1980s. It features the heel stable Gokuaku Domei, led by Dump Matsumoto, and its feud with the Crush Gals (known here as the \"Fresh Gals\").\n\nGokuaku Doumei Dump Matsumoto would be used as the basis for the overseas Master System game, Pro Wrestling.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/gokuaku-doumei-dump-matsumoto--1", "videos": [{"id": 190217, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "UxXk9qDTlws", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UxXk9qDTlws", "title": "Gokuuaku Doumei Dump Matsumoto (Master System) \u2014 Full Playthrough ", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UxXk9qDTlws/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}